Two scripts to copy the selection of the frontmost application to either the selected group ("Copy Selection To...") or to the group "Incoming" ("Copy Selection To Incoming"). To use them, activate the script menu extra and copy the scripts afterwards to the folder "~/Library/Scripts/"\
