A script to add a link to the current document (e.g. a PowerPoint presentation or an Excel spreadsheet) to the DEVONthink Pro database. To use this script, activate the script menu extra (see "/Utilities/AppleScript/Install Script Menu") and copy the script afterwards to the folder "~/Library/Scripts/".
