\f1\b \cf0 Mail Rule Action Import\
\pard\tx1440\tx2880\tx4320\tx5760\tx7200\slleading40\ql\qnatural

\f0\b0 \cf0 \
This script imports messages depending on actions of Mail rules. Just create one or more new rules in the preferences of Apple's Mail, define the desired criteria, add the action "Execute Script" to the rules and select this script. \ul Note: \ulnone This script doesn't require a specific location and sets the creation/modification date of the imported messages to the receipt date and the URL to the sender's address.
