\f1\b \cf0 \page Save to DEVONthink Pro\
\pard\tx1440\tx2880\tx4320\tx5760\tx7200\slleading40\ql\qnatural

\f0\b0 \cf0 \
Copy this script to the folder "PDF Services" inside one of the Library directories. If there's no "PDF Services" folder, create one using the Finder.  Afterwards the print panel of every application provides a new popup button to save the document in DEVONthink Pro. \ul Note:\ulnone  This requires an installed printer to work properly! }